    "detailed_description": "Blocktiful is a relaxing puzzle/sandbox game.<br />\r\nCombine resources and find recipes to create your own little world. Refine your created landscapes by changing the look of your recipes, whether on land or in the sea. <br />\r\nGradually unlock new resources or features that, for example, change your world to a certain season.<br />\r\nRebuild certain templates to make your world special.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere is no specific goal. Let your creativity run wild and build a world the way you like it!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBlocktiful is inspired by the great games Townscaper, Islanders and Dorfromantik.",
    "about_the_game": "Blocktiful is a relaxing puzzle/sandbox game.<br />\r\nCombine resources and find recipes to create your own little world. Refine your created landscapes by changing the look of your recipes, whether on land or in the sea. <br />\r\nGradually unlock new resources or features that, for example, change your world to a certain season.<br />\r\nRebuild certain templates to make your world special.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere is no specific goal. Let your creativity run wild and build a world the way you like it!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBlocktiful is inspired by the great games Townscaper, Islanders and Dorfromantik.",
